The '''Vice-chairman of the Socialist Party of Burawa''' is a senior leadership position within the [[Socialist Party of Burawa]], subordinate to the [[Leader of the Socialist Party of Burawa]]. The vice-chairman serves as deputy to the party leader and assumes leadership responsibilities in the leader's absence.

The position is filled by vote of the party congress, which convenes to elect party leadership.

